&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; AI Builder&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;BGC, Taguig City. (2 x onsite per week &amp;nbsp;hybrid set up)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an AI Builder, a full-stack AI software engineer, you will drive the engine of our core AI innovation, acting as a visionary who leverages cutting-edge artificial intelligence tools and New Ways of Working (NWoW) methodologies to design and deliver high-quality solutions at unprecedented speed. You will operate at the critical intersection of executive strategy and technical execution, embodying the principles of &quot;Vibe Engineering&quot;—balancing rapid delivery and organizational momentum with technical excellence, security, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will guide a team of talented engineers to transform theoretical explorations into practical, production-grade solutions, fostering a high-performance culture that uses AI-powered development tools and automated testing to redefine market leadership.Has value-driven delivery mindset, embodies the DevOps mindset, and an advocate for the process transformation through various automation and AI technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution design and architecture:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process analysis and optimization. Together with the Process Owner (PO), and analyze the current process, and identify challenges and opportunities to improve to deliver tangible results towards the business goals. Translate business requirements into user stories, technical specifications, blueprints, and documentation by leveraging AI tools for maximum efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and govern scalable, secure, and maintainable enterprise AI solutions using AI-assisted architecture patterns and frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate and govern business readiness by coordinating with the project team, and ensures all requirements in the Business Readiness Checklist are considered, and typically sets up BRC kickoff/closure sessions and walks through BR items with the squad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage agile artifact and structure documentation: Responsible for producing and centralizing project documentation, including Solution Design Documents (SDD) and Solution Architecture document, API specifications, git commit documentations, and operational runbooks, ensuring all project knowledge is captured for long-term sustainability. In addition, in collaboration with the assigned Scrum Master (SM), he/she co-leads the creation and maintenance of essential Agile artifacts, including prioritized backlogs, user stories with clear acceptance criteria, and technical debt logs to ensure transparency and delivery velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote the Lean Six Sigma mindset, a pro-active and data-driven approach that encourages every team member to identify problems, eliminate inefficiencies, and improve quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-Enhanced Development &amp;amp; Solution Implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead solution development using AI-powered IDEs (e.g., Cursor, GitHub Copilot,), advanced code generation tools, and automated development assistants to accelerate delivery without compromising quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System integration &amp;amp; interoperability. Responsible for applying and/or integrating AI models into existing systems (e.g., core wallet, CRM, SAP, and others). Design and develop robust APIs and middleware layers that ensure seamless data flow and functional interoperability between AI agents and legacy infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-system model application. Drive the horizontal application of AI models across different business units, ensuring that a single model or framework can be leveraged to enhance multiple core functions, from customer-facing interfaces to back-end settlement systems..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalize AI models into production systems by collaborating closely with data science and machine learning teams to collaborate with AI Scientists and collaborate in applying AI model tuning, and experimental validation, and ensure model integration, robust deployment, and full production readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to &quot;Security by Design&quot;. Secure the AI lifecycle against emerging threats, such as prompt injection, data poisoning, and model inversion, by integrating automated security scanning and vulnerability assessments. In addition, design and implement AI solutions ensuring robust encryption of PII data and compliance with global data protection standards (e.g., PH Data Privacy Act, GDPR, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New Ways of Working (NWoW) and Delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive agile delivery through iterative sprints, rapid prototyping, and continuous feedback loops to accelerate learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish optimized CI/CD pipelines and DevOps practices specifically tailored for AI-accelerated development and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance speed-to-market with technical excellence, ensuring solutions are performant, secure, and compliant with enterprise standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Collaboration &amp;amp; Advocacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate architectural trade-offs and technical decisions to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with stakeholders across IT, security, and compliance to ensure robust data governance and seamless system integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evangelize AI best practices amongst peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Expertise &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in software development and solution architecture, with at least 3 years hands-on in building Machine Learning (ML) models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of hands-on experience specifically with AI-powered development tools such as Cursor, GitHub Copilot, Tabnine, or Amazon CodeWhisperer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern programming languages (Python, Java, TypeScript, or Go) and cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, or GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of microservices, APIs, containerization (Docker, Kubernetes), and event-driven systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Methodology &amp;amp; Cognitive Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record implementing Agile/Scrum, DevOps, and familiar with MLOps principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced understanding of LLM integration, prompt engineering, and automated validation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in rapidly evolving, AI-driven environments with a creative and systematic approach to problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, capable of translating complex concepts for both technical teams and non-technical management through brown-bag and/or project update sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: Master’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, AI, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications: AWS/Azure/GCP Solutions Architect, TOGAF, or Certified Kubernetes Administrator. Lean Six Sigma certification is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry Experience: Background in banking, fintech, or other highly regulated industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovation: Active contributions to open-source projects or demonstrated initiative in adopting emerging technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title:&lt;/strong&gt; AI Integration Engineer&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Python or .NET, REST APIs, Azure Functions, Azure API Management, MCP, Microservices, Workflow Orchestration, OAuth, RBAC, API Security, Enterprise Integration&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Brazil&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mode:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We at &lt;strong&gt;Coforge&lt;/strong&gt; are hiring &lt;strong&gt;AI Integration Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;with the following skill set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable APIs, connectors, MCP tools, and service contracts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate agents with SharePoint, SAP, Databricks, SQL, and other enterprise systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement orchestration, state management, retries, exceptions, and workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply authentication, authorization, RBAC, source restrictions, least privilege, and API governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable platform utilities and maintain reliability and scalability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Information Systems, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise integration, backend, API, or platform engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with REST APIs, microservices, authentication, and cloud-native services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating enterprise systems and implementing production-grade operational controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Azure services, DevOps practices, and secure API design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SharePoint, SAP, Databricks, Azure SQL, and other enterprise-system integrations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building MCP servers or agent tool interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-driven and long-running workflow architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Developer or Integration Services certification.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posted On:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;21-09-2026&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Coforge, we hire professionals based solely on their skills and do not discriminate based on age, disability, religion, gender, sexual orientation, socioeconomic status, or nationality.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; AI Powered QA Lead&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;BGC, Taguig City. (2 x onsite per week &amp;nbsp;hybrid set up)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a visionary Quality Assurance Lead to spearhead the transformation of our quality engineering practices through cutting-edge AI integration and innovative working methodologies. This role demands a strategic leader who can seamlessly blend traditional quality expertise with AI-powered tools while championing &quot;Vibe Engineering&quot; – a philosophy that balances rapid delivery with uncompromising quality standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI-Driven Quality Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Tool Architecture: Design and implement comprehensive AI-powered QA strategies, leveraging machine learning models for predictive quality analytics, automated test generation, and intelligent defect prediction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automated Testing Evolution: Build next-generation test automation frameworks powered by AI, including self-healing test scripts, intelligent test prioritization, and adaptive test coverage analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality Intelligence: Develop AI-driven quality dashboards and insights that enable data-driven decision-making, risk forecasting, and continuous improvement initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Ways of Working Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile Transformation: Lead the adoption of modern agile methodologies tailored for AI-enhanced development cycles, including DevOps integration and continuous testing practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapid Delivery Frameworks: Implement streamlined processes that accelerate time-to-market while maintaining rigorous quality gates through intelligent automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Foster a culture of innovation by working closely with development, product, and operations teams to embed quality throughout the entire SDLC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vibe Engineering Champion&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality Culture Builder: Cultivate an organizational mindset where speed and quality coexist harmoniously, emphasizing the &quot;quality at speed&quot; philosophy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovation Steward: Lead experimental initiatives that explore emerging technologies and methodologies to enhance both delivery velocity and quality outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Talent Development: Mentor and coach QA team members in AI tools, modern testing practices, and adaptive working approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/ML Proficiency: Proven experience with AI/ML tools for software testing, including platforms like Testim, Mabl, Applitools, or similar AI-powered testing solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern QA Stack: Deep knowledge of contemporary testing frameworks (Selenium, Cypress, Playwright, Appium) enhanced with AI capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DevOps &amp;amp; CI/CD: Strong background in CI/CD pipelines, containerization, and cloud-native testing environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming Skills: Proficiency in at least one modern programming language (Python, Java, JavaScript/TypeScript) for test automation and AI integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience Requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in Quality Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;hands-on experience with AI-powered testing tools and methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of implementing &quot;New Ways of Working&quot; in fast-paced, agile environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading digital transformation initiatives in quality engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title:&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; AI&amp;nbsp; Scrum Master&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;BGC, Taguig City. (2 x onsite per week &amp;nbsp;hybrid set up)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will guide a team of talented engineers to transform theoretical explorations into practical, production-grade solutions, fostering a high-performance culture that uses AI-powered development tools and automated testing to redefine market leadership.Has value-driven delivery mindset, embodies the DevOps mindset, and an advocate for the process transformation through various automation and AI technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Facilitation &amp;amp; Team Enablement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate all Agile ceremonies, including Sprint Planning, Daily Stand-ups, Sprint Reviews, Retrospectives, Backlog Refinement sessions, and Release Planning activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach the squad on Agile, Scrum, Lean, and New Ways of Working (NWoW) principles, ensuring consistent adoption of best practices and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a high-performing, self-organizing, and cross-functional team culture that promotes accountability, collaboration, and transparency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove impediments and blockers that may impact sprint commitments, development velocity, or team productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and communicate sprint progress, team capacity, velocity, burn-down metrics, and delivery risks to stakeholders and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Owners, Business Owners, Architects, and Engineering Teams to ensure backlog readiness, prioritization, and alignment with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure user stories are well-defined, properly estimated, and supported by clear acceptance criteria before entering sprint execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate risk identification, dependency management, and issue resolution across multiple teams and workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support release planning and coordination activities to ensure successful deployment and business readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote predictable, value-driven delivery by balancing scope, timeline, resource capacity, and technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Título del puesto:&lt;/strong&gt; Analista de Seguridad de Aplicaciones&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Habilidades clave:&lt;/strong&gt; Seguridad de API y aplicaciones web, Microsoft Azure, GitHub, Git, SAST, SCA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiencia:&lt;/strong&gt; Mínimo 3 años de experiencia en seguridad de aplicaciones y análisis de vulnerabilidades.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ubicación:&lt;/strong&gt; Lima, Perú.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modalidad:&lt;/strong&gt; Remota, con disponibilidad para asistir a la oficina en Lima cuando lo solicite el cliente.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En Coforge estamos buscando un &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analista de Seguridad de Aplicaciones Mid&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;con conocimientos en seguridad de API y aplicaciones web, herramientas de control de versiones y análisis de seguridad del código. Buscamos un profesional con capacidad analítica y orientación a la identificación de vulnerabilidades y al fortalecimiento de la seguridad durante el ciclo de desarrollo de software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilidades principales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analizar la seguridad de API y aplicaciones web para identificar posibles vulnerabilidades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aplicar herramientas de análisis estático de seguridad del código (SAST) y análisis de composición de software (SCA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizar Git y GitHub para gestionar repositorios y apoyar la integración de prácticas de seguridad en el desarrollo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aplicar conocimientos de Microsoft Azure en el contexto de seguridad de aplicaciones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apoyar la identificación, evaluación y seguimiento de vulnerabilidades, contribuyendo a la mejora continua de la seguridad del software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisitos indispensables&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conocimientos de Microsoft Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manejo de GitHub y Git.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conocimientos de seguridad en API y aplicaciones web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conocimiento de herramientas y metodologías de análisis estático de seguridad del código (SAST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conocimiento de análisis de composición de software (SCA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publicado el:&lt;/strong&gt; 13-10-2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;En Coforge, contratamos profesionales únicamente en función de sus habilidades y calificaciones, y no discriminamos en función de la edad, discapacidad, religión, género, orientación sexual, estado socioeconómico o nacionalidad.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Título del puesto:&lt;/strong&gt; Analista QA Funcional Senior&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Habilidades clave:&lt;/strong&gt; Aseguramiento de Calidad de Software, Pruebas Funcionales, Pruebas Integrales, Pruebas de Extremo a Extremo (E2E), Pruebas de Aceptación de Usuario (UAT), ISTQB, Postman, SQL, Gherkin, SAP FI, Sistemas de Gestión de Promociones Comerciales (TPM, TPX y TPO), Gestión de Defectos, Metodologías Ágiles y Scrum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiencia:&lt;/strong&gt; De 3 a 5 años de experiencia en aseguramiento de calidad de software, con al menos 1 año en pruebas funcionales de sistemas de gestión de promociones comerciales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ubicación:&lt;/strong&gt; Lima, Perú.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modalidad:&lt;/strong&gt; Híbrida, con asistencia presencial tres veces por semana en Miraflores.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En Coforge estamos buscando un &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analista QA Funcional Senior&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; con experiencia en planificación, ejecución y gestión de pruebas de software, especialmente en sistemas de gestión de promociones comerciales. Buscamos profesionales con capacidad analítica, orientación a riesgos y experiencia coordinando validaciones con equipos técnicos y usuarios de negocio para garantizar la calidad de las soluciones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilidades principales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diseñar y definir planes integrales de pruebas, estableciendo cobertura, estrategia, estimaciones y prioridades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analizar requerimientos funcionales e identificar escenarios de prueba de acuerdo con los procesos de negocio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planificar y ejecutar pruebas funcionales, integrales, de extremo a extremo (E2E) y de aceptación de usuario (UAT).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aplicar enfoques de pruebas basadas en riesgos, priorizando los escenarios según su impacto en los procesos críticos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elaborar escenarios de prueba utilizando el formato Gherkin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acompañar a los usuarios de negocio durante las pruebas UAT, facilitando la validación de requerimientos y resultados.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crear, registrar y realizar seguimiento de defectos mediante herramientas de gestión de pruebas, así como elaborar reportes de avance y resultados.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ejecutar pruebas manuales de API utilizando Postman.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Realizar consultas SQL para validar información y resultados de las pruebas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crear, preparar y mantener datos de prueba para ejecuciones unitarias y masivas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participar en proyectos relacionados con sistemas ERP y procesos empresariales, considerando las funcionalidades asociadas a SAP FI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinar actividades de QA con equipos técnicos, usuarios de negocio y otros participantes del proyecto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liderar actividades de pruebas y contribuir a la mejora continua de los procesos de aseguramiento de calidad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requisitos indispensables&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formación universitaria en Ingeniería de Sistemas, Informática o carreras afines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De 3 a 5 años de experiencia en aseguramiento de calidad de software como QA Senior, liderando y ejecutando pruebas funcionales y UAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia obligatoria de al menos 1 año en pruebas funcionales de sistemas de gestión de promociones comerciales en empresas de consumo masivo, utilizando plataformas TPM, TPX, TPO o soluciones equivalentes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Al menos 1 año de experiencia liderando actividades de pruebas y gestión de QA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia en planificación, diseño y ejecución de pruebas funcionales, integrales, E2E y UAT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia en acompañamiento y coordinación de pruebas de aceptación con usuarios de negocio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conocimientos de ISTQB Foundation Level o preparación para obtener esta certificación.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia en gestión y seguimiento de defectos, documentación de evidencias y elaboración de reportes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiencia en pruebas manuales de API utilizando Postman.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conocimientos de SQL para validación de datos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacidad para definir escenarios de prueba en formato Gherkin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conocimientos de metodologías ágiles, como Scrum, y de modelos tradicionales de trabajo, como cascada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacidad analítica, orientación a riesgos, comunicación efectiva, resolución de problemas y coordinación con equipos técnicos y de negocio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
