&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Enterprise Solutioning &amp;amp; BOM Management&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop accurate and detailed Bills of Materials (BOMs) for enterprise infrastructure solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate solution architecture into hardware, software, licensing, and support requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with Solution Architects to ensure technical accuracy of proposed solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Validate BOM completeness before commercial submissions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify cost optimization opportunities while maintaining technical compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Infrastructure Costing &amp;amp; Pricing&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare detailed infrastructure costing models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand OEM pricing structures, discounts, rebates, and commercial models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform hardware and software cost estimation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evaluate alternative technologies based on cost and business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure pricing aligns with approved commercial guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;RFP / RFI / RFQ Support&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support end-to-end responses for RFPs, RFIs, and RFQs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with OEM vendors and distributors to obtain quotations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compare vendor pricing and recommend the most competitive commercial options.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure BOM compliance with customer technical requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage proposal timelines and vendor follow-ups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Vendor Management&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engage with infrastructure vendors for pricing, quotations, and product updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain relationships with OEMs and distributors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track hardware lifecycle and End-of-Life (EOL) products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor new technology releases and pricing trends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Infrastructure Knowledge&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop BOMs covering technologies such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Servers (Rack, Blade, Hyperconverged)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Storage (SAN, NAS, Object Storage)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking (LAN, WAN, SD-WAN)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Firewalls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Load Balancers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtualization platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backup &amp;amp; Recovery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating Systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database Licensing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Middleware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring Platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Centre Infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cabling and Rack Components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Power, UPS and Environmental Components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Stakeholder Management&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Present infrastructure solution options to internal stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explain costing assumptions and pricing models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare executive-level PowerPoint presentations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support bid review meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with Sales, Procurement, Finance, and Delivery teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Documentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain BOM repository.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update pricing databases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain standard infrastructure templates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Produce technical documentation for commercial submissions.&lt;/p&gt;

