&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Project Manager (Data PM)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Singapore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12 months contract&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Data Project Manager (Data PM)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the successful delivery of data and analytics initiatives. The ideal candidate will manage end-to-end project execution, coordinate cross-functional data teams, and serve as the primary liaison between business stakeholders and technical teams. This role requires strong project management expertise, experience with &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/strong&gt; data technologies, and a solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Generative AI, Agentic AI, and Large Language Model (LLM)-based solutions&lt;/strong&gt;. The Data PM will be responsible for ensuring projects are delivered on time, within scope, and aligned with business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roles &lt;strong&gt;&amp;amp; responsibilities &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage end-to-end data projects, including planning, scope definition, resource allocation, execution, delivery, and project closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define project timelines, milestones, deliverables, and success criteria while ensuring adherence to budget and schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform effort estimation for data engineering, analytics, AI, and data platform initiatives, ensuring accurate project planning and resource utilization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define technical scope in collaboration with architects, data engineers, and solution teams to ensure alignment with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of contact between business stakeholders and technical teams, translating business requirements into scalable data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project risks, issues, dependencies, and scope changes while providing regular status updates to stakeholders and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and coordinate cross-functional data teams, including Data Engineers, Data Analysts, Data Scientists, ML Engineers, and Architects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove project blockers, facilitate technical discussions, and ensure timely decision-making to keep projects on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review technical designs, project deliverables, and solution approaches to ensure quality, scalability, and alignment with architectural standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Agile project delivery by facilitating sprint planning, backlog prioritization, stand-ups, retrospectives, and release planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams to ensure successful implementation of data pipelines, analytics platforms, and AI/ML solutions on Google Cloud Platform (GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the adoption and delivery of Generative AI, Agentic AI, and LLM-based solutions by coordinating technical teams and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor project KPIs, resource utilization, and delivery metrics to continuously improve project execution and team performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare executive-level presentations, project reports, dashboards, and governance updates for leadership and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with organizational governance, security, and data management standards throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, Data Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing end-to-end data, analytics, or AI projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Google Cloud Platform (GCP) data services and modern cloud data architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data engineering, ETL, data warehousing, and analytics platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of Generative AI, Agentic AI, and Large Language Model (LLM) solutions and their enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project planning, effort estimation, risk management, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile/Scrum environments and managing cross-functional technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with project management tools such as Jira, Confluence, Azure DevOps, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, PRINCE2, Scrum Master, or Agile certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GCP services such as BigQuery, Cloud Storage, Dataflow, Dataproc, Pub/Sub, Vertex AI, and Cloud Composer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
