&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DB2 DBA Supporting Applictaion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Singapore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;a) Reviewing and optimising SQL queries written by application developers to ensure optimal performance and adherence to database standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;b) Assisting in database design activities, including table structures, indexes, and relationships to support new application features or enhancements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;c) Troubleshooting database-related issues reported by application teams, including SQL error codes, performance problems, and data integrity concerns&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;d) Supporting database changes through the development lifecycle (DEV, TEST, UAT, PROD), including coordinating database object migrations between environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;e) Monitoring application database performance and implementing necessary tuning measures like reorganising tablespaces, updating statistics, and adjusting buffer pools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;f) Providing guidance to application developers on DB2 best practices, coding standards, and efficient query writing techniques&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;g) Supporting application testing activities by helping with data refresh requests, test data preparation, and database-related test case validation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;a) Strong background in IT, Computer Science / Computer Engineering, or related discipline&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;b) Minimum 5 years of relevant working experience in the above technology is preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;c) Relevant experience in the following would be advantageous:&lt;br&gt;• Working with JCL (Jon Control Language)&lt;br&gt;• Understanding of VSAM and other mainframe storage concepts&lt;br&gt;• Familiar with database utilities and tools&lt;br&gt;• Experience with database backup and recovery procedures&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Encora&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Encora is a global company that offers Software and Digital Engineering solutions. Our practices include Cloud Services, Product Engineering &amp;amp; Application Modernization, Data &amp;amp; Analytics, Digital Experience &amp;amp; Design Services, DevSecOps, Cybersecurity, Quality Engineering, AI &amp;amp; LLM Engineering, among others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Encora, we hire professionals based solely on their skills and do not discriminate based on age, disability, religion, gender, sexual orientation, socioeconomic status, or nationality&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
