&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. System Analysis &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse business/technical requirements and translate them into &lt;strong&gt;data flows and integration designs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with upstream and downstream teams to define &lt;strong&gt;data contracts and interfaces&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps, inefficiencies and risks in current data movement processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose pragmatic solutions balancing speed, quality and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Integration &amp;amp; Data Movement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement &lt;strong&gt;data movement across systems&lt;/strong&gt; using:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SFTP and file based transfers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Batch pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
