&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Data Preparation for GenAI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data ingestion and preparation for GenAI use cases:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;document ingestion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;data aggregation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;enrichment and transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with structured and unstructured data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data is usable for downstream AI workflows (RAG, search, investigation flows)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are not asking them to build models, just make data usable for them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Delivery &amp;amp; Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
