&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Mainframe Backup Administrator to manage and maintain the integrity of our mainframe backup and recovery environment. You’ll be responsible for day-to-day backup operations, tape lifecycle management, and supporting disaster recovery activities to ensure data availability and compliance with SLAs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage and monitor daily mainframe backup operations using CA 1 (Tape Management System).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure successful execution of scheduled backup jobs, troubleshoot failures, and perform root cause analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Validate backup logs, reports, and error messages to ensure compliance with SLAs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform tape operations and manage the full tape lifecycle, from allocation to offsite storage and destruction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Protection &amp;amp; RecoveryExecute mainframe backups using ADRDSSU and FlashCopy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support resiliency planning, DR testing, and recovery execution during drills and real events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve complex issues in backup and recovery scenarios to minimize downtime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Process &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Follow ITIL processes for Incident, Problem, and Change Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain documentation for procedures, configurations, and recovery playbooks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with infrastructure, storage, and application teams to align backup strategies with business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in mainframe backup operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong expertise with CA 1, tape operations, and tape lifecycle management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience with mainframe backup using ADRDSSU and FlashCopy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid knowledge of mainframe infrastructure, storage management, and backup concepts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with resiliency planning, DR testing, and recovery execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid troubleshooting and problem-solving skills in backup and recovery scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with ITIL processes: Incident, Problem, Change Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work in a 24x7 environment with on-call support as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong attention to detail and communication skills for incident and stakeholder updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to HaveExperience with IBM z/OS and storage subsystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to modernizing legacy backup processes or integrating with cloud storage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scripting experience in REXX, JCL, or similar mainframe languages.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
