&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a skilled and detail-oriented &lt;strong&gt;QA Automation Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Quality Assurance team. The ideal candidate will have strong expertise in test automation, API testing, database validation, and modern QA practices. This role requires hands-on experience in designing and maintaining automation frameworks, collaborating with cross-functional teams, and ensuring high-quality software releases in an Agile environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
