&lt;p&gt;Execute functional, regression, integration, and end-to-end testing using automation frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and enhance automation frameworks using &lt;strong&gt;Appium&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Playwright&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong&gt;Selenium WebDriver with Java&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform API testing using &lt;strong&gt;Postman&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Rest Assured&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Validate application data through SQL/database testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create, manage, and execute test plans, test cases, and test scenarios using test management tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify, log, track, and verify defects using tools such as &lt;strong&gt;JIRA&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Azure DevOps&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;Appium&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Playwright&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong experience in &lt;strong&gt;Test Management&lt;/strong&gt; and test planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;Selenium WebDriver using Java&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;API Testing&lt;/strong&gt; using &lt;strong&gt;Postman&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Rest Assured&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;SQL/database testing&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with defect tracking tools such as &lt;strong&gt;JIRA&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Azure DevOps&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
