&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Agile/Scrum&lt;/strong&gt; methodologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and debugging skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication, collaboration, and stakeholder management abilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should be available to join in a short notice&lt;/p&gt;
