&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Transform prototypes, internal automation tools, and predictive models into scalable, production-ready features in collaboration with product and data teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optimize backend worker queues, background jobs, and cloud infrastructure to ensure high availability and low latency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leverage AI-assisted development tools to accelerate coding, improve code quality, conduct code reviews, and automate testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build dashboards that provide visibility into automation pipelines and support integrations with platforms such as UiPath and Gemini Agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with team members and contribute to a culture of mentorship and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
