&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3+ years of experience developing full-stack web applications, including complex API integrations and background job processing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong experience with Ruby on Rails, SQL databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL, or Snowflake), HTML5, CSS3, and modern JavaScript frameworks and technologies such as Node.js and React.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience developing, deploying, and monitoring scalable applications in a public cloud environment (AWS, GCP, or Azure).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Practical exposure to automation tools, RPA bots, automated agents, or Document Intelligence/Intelligent Document Processing (IDP) solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience integrating AI-assisted development tools into daily workflows to improve productivity and code quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to develop complete product features across the frontend and backend based on specifications or mockups.&lt;/p&gt;
