&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compliance with HIPAA rules and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work remotely with a private, quiet workspace and high-speed internet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness and ability to communicate through webcam, video conferences, and phone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building AI agents using tools such as OpenClaw, UiPath, or Gemini AI Studio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with Document Intelligence APIs such as Azure Document Intelligence, AWS Textract, or Google Cloud Document AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with complex state machines and message brokers such as RabbitMQ, Redis, Kafka, or Pub/Sub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
